Bundled component: QR Code generator library (C++)

The QR encoding behind the Bundle page's "Show QR code" is Project Nayuki's
QR Code generator library, vendored unmodified as src/qrcodegen.hpp and
src/qrcodegen.cpp (upstream release v1.8.0, from
https://github.com/nayuki/QR-Code-generator). It is distributed under the MIT
License, reproduced below as its terms require. The rest of Kelp is
GPL-3.0-only; MIT is compatible with it, and this file is installed alongside
the app so the notice travels with a binary-only distribution too.

